      "text": "Engineering and invention span human civilization — from Archimedes applying mathematics to mechanisms to Elon Musk vertically integrating rocket manufacturing. The through-line: applying systematic knowledge (mathematical, empirical, or intuitive) to build things that work."
    },
    {
