        "title": "Engineers and Inventors - Overview",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "MEDIEVAL & RENAISSANCE (900–1600)\n  ───────────────────────────────────\n  Al-Jazari (1136–1206): automata, crankshaft, camshaft, water clocks\n  Leonardo da Vinci (1452–1519): notebooks — hundreds of inventions\n                                  never built, many technically sound"
    },
    {
      "id": "00-OVERVIEW.md#006",
      "path": [
        "00-OVERVIEW.md"
