        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "SCIENTIFIC REVOLUTION (1600–1750)\n  ───────────────────────────────────\n  Huygens (1629–1695): pendulum clock, spring balance wheel\n  Newcomen (1664–1729): first practical steam engine (atmospheric)\n  Steam power changes the energy equation"
    },
    {
      "id": "00-OVERVIEW.md#007",
      "path": [
        "00-OVERVIEW.md"
      ],
