      "text": "TRANSPORTATION (1880–1940)\n  ──────────────────────────\n  Benz (1844–1929): first true automobile (1885)\n  Diesel (1858–1913): compression-ignition engine (1897)\n  Ford (1863–1947): assembly line, Model T mass production\n  Wright Brothers (1867/71–1912/48): controlled powered flight (1903)\n  Whittle (1907–1996): jet engine (1930 patent; first flight 1941)"
    },
