      "text": "STRUCTURES & MATERIALS (1850–1930)\n  ────────────────────────────────────\n  Bessemer (1813–1898): Bessemer process — mass steel production\n  Goodyear (1800–1860): vulcanized rubber\n  Roebling (1806–1869): wire rope, Brooklyn Bridge design\n  Eiffel (1832–1923): Eiffel Tower, Statue of Liberty armature"
    },
