      "text": "COMPUTING & ELECTRONICS (1830–1970)\n  ────────────────────────────────────\n  Babbage, Hollerith, Atanasoff, Von Neumann — see computing-pioneers/\n  Shockley + Bardeen + Brattain (1947): transistor\n  Kilby (1958) + Noyce (1959): integrated circuit — independently"
    },
