      "text": "AEROSPACE (1900–2000)\n  ──────────────────────\n  Goddard (1882–1945): first liquid-fueled rockets\n  Tsiolkovsky (1857–1935): rocket equation, space station theory\n  Von Braun (1912–1977): V-2, Saturn V\n  Korolev (1907–1966): Sputnik, Vostok, R-7 ICBM\n  Kelly Johnson (1910–1990): U-2, SR-71, Skunk Works model"
    },
